WEBVTT

00:14.097 --> 00:15.098
You're done now.

00:15.181 --> 00:17.142
Those who control auto-tracking Stands…

00:17.225 --> 00:19.102
It's F.F.!

00:19.185 --> 00:21.104
Why are they at this Disciplinary Wing?

00:27.068 --> 00:28.236
He has a disc!

00:29.529 --> 00:31.322
Pale Snake is nearby!

00:32.032 --> 00:32.907
Where is he?

00:35.869 --> 00:37.120
No way…

00:37.203 --> 00:38.413
The one who threw it was…

00:39.414 --> 00:40.623
It can't be him!

00:41.374 --> 00:43.585
So the one who controls Pale Snake is…

00:44.919 --> 00:46.588
You are…

00:47.172 --> 00:48.506
Father Pucchi.

02:20.598 --> 02:23.017
F.F. feared one thing above all else.

02:23.101 --> 02:26.771
It wasn't the destruction of their body,

02:26.855 --> 02:30.233
but the elimination
of their own intellect.

02:31.985 --> 02:38.158
I remember everything
since the day I met Jolyne.

02:39.117 --> 02:41.494
The weird graffiti on prison phones,

02:42.078 --> 02:44.956
the lint-covered blankets on the bed,
and the smell of garbage.

02:45.540 --> 02:47.041
The guard's shouts,

02:47.625 --> 02:51.254
the sounds of doors opening and closing,
and the toilet flushing, even.

02:52.964 --> 02:55.967
Fooling around with Jolyne
and the others and laughing together.

02:56.050 --> 02:57.176
I remember them all.

02:58.219 --> 03:04.392
But before I met Jolyne at the farm,
though I lived there for years,

03:04.475 --> 03:08.146
all I can recall from that time are
memories that are like a machine's.

03:08.813 --> 03:09.939
That's all.

03:10.440 --> 03:13.109
I followed orders
without ever questioning why

03:13.192 --> 03:16.154
and spent the days
guarding Pale Snake's discs.

03:17.614 --> 03:19.115
But now, I know

03:19.198 --> 03:22.869
that to live means to make memories.

03:23.995 --> 03:26.122
I fear losing them the most.

03:28.124 --> 03:30.501
Jolyne is on a mission to save her father

03:30.585 --> 03:34.589
and is willing to risk her life
for the ones she cares about like Ermes.

03:34.672 --> 03:37.967
That's probably because
she has good memories of them.

03:38.843 --> 03:41.930
That's what powers humans up.

03:43.056 --> 03:45.808
Memories give humans
power to keep going at a cellular level.

03:46.726 --> 03:50.772
This is an understanding that I,
F.F., lacked before meeting Jolyne.

03:52.523 --> 03:53.358
That's right.

03:54.275 --> 03:55.193
That is…

03:55.777 --> 03:59.239
That is what it means
to be an intelligent being.

04:02.200 --> 04:05.328
Which do you prioritize?

04:05.411 --> 04:06.955
Is it me?

04:07.038 --> 04:10.458
Or is it finishing D an' G?

04:15.588 --> 04:17.090
You hesitated for a split second!

04:17.173 --> 04:19.676
That will cost you your life!

04:27.725 --> 04:31.980
I gave you intellect and a Stand.

04:33.523 --> 04:35.191
I am taking it back.

04:36.484 --> 04:40.738
When I think about Jolyne,
I feel courage swelling up inside me.

04:41.572 --> 04:43.700
This is what memories do.

04:44.659 --> 04:47.704
This is… my intellect!

04:50.248 --> 04:51.666
What?

04:58.548 --> 04:59.632
No…

05:00.758 --> 05:03.011
Is F.F. planning to--

05:06.347 --> 05:08.433
Their bodily fluids entered his body!

05:14.397 --> 05:16.357
Impossible…

05:21.988 --> 05:24.032
Am I…

05:30.121 --> 05:32.457
Looks like F.F. did it.

05:32.957 --> 05:35.043
They must have killed its User.

05:38.171 --> 05:39.339
Where is the fruit?

05:56.272 --> 05:57.607
What the hell?

05:58.691 --> 06:00.568
Does this mean that it's born?

06:01.277 --> 06:04.822
Is this what Pale Snake wanted?

06:07.909 --> 06:10.912
What the hell is this thing?

06:11.704 --> 06:13.706
Why was it given life?

06:14.248 --> 06:16.250
Why does it exist here?

06:17.001 --> 06:20.963
Were the prisoners mutated
just to give life to this thing?

06:21.714 --> 06:26.135
Now that it's born,
my body is no longer mutating.

06:26.219 --> 06:27.678
It stopped turning into a plant.

06:36.979 --> 06:39.440
You must not let F.F. escape!

06:39.524 --> 06:41.734
Read the memory inside the disc!

06:42.318 --> 06:47.323
Tell me the whereabouts
of the spawn of Dio's bone!

06:47.406 --> 06:50.785
Will I even last 30 seconds
when I'm exposed like this?

06:50.868 --> 06:51.869
I need water.

06:52.370 --> 06:56.624
I need to tell Jolyne
who Pale Snake really is!

06:59.043 --> 06:59.877
Shit.

07:00.461 --> 07:03.506
I have to tell her that
he's the prison's chaplain, Father Pucchi!

07:06.634 --> 07:10.221
Are you trying to reach the
faucet at the entrance?

07:10.304 --> 07:14.433
Before you go,
I have one question for you!

07:18.104 --> 07:20.106
You can't escape my Stand!

07:37.874 --> 07:43.379
There's one thing I want to ask, F.F.

07:44.088 --> 07:46.048
It's a very simple question.

07:46.132 --> 07:47.592
Did you see it?

07:48.259 --> 07:50.761
Did you see the thing born
at the Disciplinary Wing?

07:51.471 --> 07:53.055
How did it look?

07:53.556 --> 07:55.183
Was it a plant?

07:55.266 --> 07:56.726
Was it beautiful?

07:56.809 --> 08:01.647
What is a priest doing
at a prison like this?

08:01.731 --> 08:05.234
I hope you understand that
I'm asking the questions here.

08:05.318 --> 08:10.823
I can easily extract your memory
and read it to understand what was born.

08:11.699 --> 08:14.869
But I wanted to know how you felt.

08:15.369 --> 08:19.999
Things like it looked soft
or that it was beautiful

08:20.082 --> 08:24.086
are your opinions, and can't be read
from a memory disc.

08:24.837 --> 08:28.216
Are you worried that the spawn
will escape?

08:28.299 --> 08:29.550
You're afraid of losing it.

08:30.384 --> 08:32.512
Is it able to move already?

08:32.595 --> 08:33.971
How the hell should I know?

08:34.055 --> 08:38.017
I'd be more worried about it
getting destroyed.

08:38.100 --> 08:41.729
No, maybe it's already done.

08:41.812 --> 08:44.732
Jolyne is with that mean asshole,
after all.

08:45.274 --> 08:47.818
If she's compelled to,
she'll finish it off.

08:47.902 --> 08:50.404
It's impossible to defeat it.

08:50.488 --> 08:52.156
That will never happen.

08:53.115 --> 08:57.787
No one can destroy it,
that much I know well.

08:57.870 --> 09:02.500
My only concern is Jolyne
causing trouble and losing it.

09:02.583 --> 09:06.546
Jotaro's memory alone is enough
to control the birthed creature,

09:07.129 --> 09:10.132
and I have his memory.

09:10.216 --> 09:13.052
We are so close to the end.

09:13.135 --> 09:14.929
What is it shaped like?

09:15.012 --> 09:18.224
Did it grow faster than you expected?

09:19.725 --> 09:22.186
I thought it was gonna drown in water.

09:22.770 --> 09:25.606
And then, what else was there?

09:25.690 --> 09:27.900
Let's see…

09:28.734 --> 09:30.861
It's stalling for time! Turn around!

09:33.948 --> 09:35.283
I did it!

09:35.366 --> 09:39.620
My soul isn't in my head,

09:39.704 --> 09:41.497
it's over there.

09:41.581 --> 09:43.541
I have water now!

09:44.041 --> 09:46.294
I can go tell Jolyne everything!

09:55.886 --> 09:57.305
Your soul, you say?

09:57.388 --> 10:02.393
No matter where your intelligence lies,
you're not the one making decisions here.

10:03.227 --> 10:06.689
I am the one who endowed you
with a Stand ability.

10:08.816 --> 10:10.443
You filthy plankton!

10:10.526 --> 10:14.238
Don't you dare give me explanations,
as if you know better than I do!

10:22.246 --> 10:25.833
My body! This water…

10:25.916 --> 10:30.046
What is streaming out of it?

10:30.796 --> 10:31.672
No, it can't be!

10:32.256 --> 10:33.674
It's steaming hot water.

10:33.758 --> 10:40.306
No aquatic organism on earth can dwell
in water hotter than 32 degrees Celsius.

10:40.389 --> 10:43.684
A different Stand ability that
turns water into hot water…

10:43.768 --> 10:45.853
…was inserted into this thing.

10:45.936 --> 10:49.940
Only I get to decide
where your intellect lies.

10:50.024 --> 10:52.526
You are using your own ability to turn

10:52.610 --> 10:54.779
the water you touch
into boiling hot water!

11:08.125 --> 11:10.086
Jolyne!

11:34.068 --> 11:35.945
STAND NAME: GREEN, GREEN, GREEN HOME
STAND MASTER: THE GREEN BABY

11:37.363 --> 11:39.198
Where is it? Where did it fall?

11:39.949 --> 11:41.951
Shit, don't tell me it drowned.

11:44.578 --> 11:46.539
No…

11:49.208 --> 11:51.377
Does it have a mind of its own?

11:51.460 --> 11:53.671
Since it's trying to escape?

11:54.296 --> 11:55.256
No…

11:55.339 --> 11:58.008
Instinct is its only drive.

11:58.092 --> 12:02.221
I don't know whether it's a plant or not,
but I don't want it to go anywhere.

12:02.805 --> 12:05.599
I can't let Pale Snake have it.

12:07.893 --> 12:08.811
Jolyne!

12:12.273 --> 12:13.899
Wait, Jolyne!

12:13.983 --> 12:16.986
Don't move, look at the rock by your foot!

12:20.489 --> 12:21.490
Listen closely.

12:21.574 --> 12:22.908
Don't take another step.

12:23.576 --> 12:25.202
Turn around and look at me.

12:30.541 --> 12:32.960
When the pebble rolled over here,
it turned into a rock.

12:33.043 --> 12:36.172
Meanwhile, Jolyne, you grew smaller.

12:37.506 --> 12:40.384
Stop! I said don't go near it!

12:45.848 --> 12:48.434
What just happened, Anastasia?

12:48.976 --> 12:51.145
Why did you grow shorter?

12:57.109 --> 13:00.070
- What's going on, Anastasia?
- Stay calm, Jolyne.

13:01.739 --> 13:05.367
By the way, how big
does that baby look to you?

13:06.410 --> 13:09.538
It hasn't changed.
Its size is the same as before.

13:09.622 --> 13:10.915
Anastasia,

13:10.998 --> 13:13.959
it looks like you are the one
who grew shorter to me.

13:14.043 --> 13:15.127
What's going on?

13:15.753 --> 13:19.215
The baby's size looks
about average to me too.

13:20.007 --> 13:21.967
Only the pebble
we kicked over got smaller.

13:22.760 --> 13:25.054
Jolyne, don't move.

13:25.638 --> 13:27.014
Stay right where you are.

13:33.312 --> 13:34.396
You're back to normal.

13:34.980 --> 13:37.691
Do you think that
this is the baby's ability?

13:37.775 --> 13:42.988
The closer we get to the baby,
the shorter we grow.

13:43.072 --> 13:44.698
I don't have a clue.

13:44.782 --> 13:46.951
That's a heavy line of questioning.

13:47.952 --> 13:51.872
Now listen, if we get halfway to the baby,

13:51.956 --> 13:54.083
my height shrinks by half.

13:54.583 --> 13:56.544
That means we have to walk twice as much.

13:56.627 --> 13:57.670
Okay.

13:57.753 --> 14:00.923
Furthermore, if we get
a fourth of the way to the baby,

14:01.006 --> 14:02.758
then the distance grows by four times.

14:03.384 --> 14:05.594
At one-eighth,
we walk eight times as much.

14:07.221 --> 14:08.847
1/32nd,

14:08.931 --> 14:10.391
1/64th,

14:10.891 --> 14:12.601
1/128th…

14:13.143 --> 14:14.603
Our body will keep shrinking,

14:14.687 --> 14:16.981
while the distance
multiplies more and more.

14:17.064 --> 14:18.566
Here is the question.

14:19.650 --> 14:22.570
Will we ever reach that baby?

14:24.196 --> 14:26.657
I say no, not in an eternity.

14:30.703 --> 14:34.707
But in order to get
my father's memory back,

14:35.583 --> 14:37.918
I have to get the baby.

14:38.002 --> 14:40.504
- Jolyne.
- Anastasia, we'll think

14:40.588 --> 14:43.090
after we've done everything we can!

14:44.592 --> 14:47.052
It's her focus.

14:47.136 --> 14:50.514
The way Jolyne can fixate
towards one goal.

14:50.598 --> 14:55.311
I'm here because I'm drawn to
the way she focuses on one thing.

14:55.394 --> 14:57.980
The ability to concentrate
enhances a person's beauty.

14:58.063 --> 15:00.858
Those eyes…

15:00.941 --> 15:05.863
In time, I'll have you gaze at me
with that intense focus of yours.

15:22.963 --> 15:24.965
Stone Ocean!

15:26.383 --> 15:28.636
I'm about to reach it! I can catch it!

15:30.554 --> 15:33.474
It's no use, Jolyne.
Pull your thread back!

15:33.557 --> 15:35.976
There is no way to reach the baby!

15:36.060 --> 15:37.436
I can't give up!

15:37.519 --> 15:38.938
There has to be an end.

15:39.021 --> 15:40.898
I mean, it's right there!

15:44.735 --> 15:47.947
What do you say to jumping off from here?

15:49.031 --> 15:51.450
If I do, I'll reach an end point.

15:51.533 --> 15:53.160
The ground is the finishing point.

15:53.243 --> 15:54.912
I have to land at some point!

15:55.996 --> 15:57.456
Stop, Jolyne! Don't--

15:57.539 --> 16:00.167
Yes! The ground is right there!

16:00.250 --> 16:01.961
I can almost reach it!

16:02.461 --> 16:03.295
What's happening?

16:04.672 --> 16:05.631
My string…

16:11.637 --> 16:13.347
What the hell is that?

16:18.435 --> 16:20.229
Don't tell me…

16:20.312 --> 16:22.356
Is this the baby's Stand?

16:22.439 --> 16:24.775
Damn, haven't I reached the ground yet?

16:28.821 --> 16:32.241
It hasn't only grown in size,
but in power as well!

16:32.324 --> 16:33.742
Its power has multiplied!

16:33.826 --> 16:37.037
This Stand… It appeared
just to drag me down,

16:37.997 --> 16:42.376
so I won't ever escape
this never-ending fall!

16:42.459 --> 16:44.003
Stone Ocean!

16:47.381 --> 16:49.800
If this is the baby's ability,

16:49.883 --> 16:53.345
then catching the Stand
is the same as catching the User!

17:04.481 --> 17:06.859
I'm shrinking!

17:06.942 --> 17:08.861
It's trying to reduce me to nothing!

17:09.486 --> 17:11.363
The end I thought I'd reach
wasn't the ground.

17:11.447 --> 17:12.614
It was this Stand!

17:19.329 --> 17:20.622
Diver Drive.

17:34.219 --> 17:38.390
The closer you get to the baby,
the smaller you get.

17:38.474 --> 17:40.476
Eventually, you will be
reduced to nothing.

17:41.143 --> 17:46.148
I don't know why a baby
with such a powerful Stand was born,

17:47.024 --> 17:48.901
but I know he will be an enemy someday.

17:48.984 --> 17:53.030
Jolyne, this baby is your enemy.

17:53.113 --> 17:54.364
But…

17:54.448 --> 17:56.116
if there's no way to defeat it,

17:56.200 --> 17:59.536
then I really can't let
Pale Snake have it.

18:12.466 --> 18:14.843
Anastasia, hold on tight!

18:19.181 --> 18:21.266
It threw the rock!

18:21.350 --> 18:22.726
Does that mean…

18:22.810 --> 18:24.394
that it's thinking for itself?

18:24.478 --> 18:28.232
The baby is now
deliberately using its ability!

18:29.399 --> 18:31.068
It's coming. Climb!

18:31.610 --> 18:33.904
We need to escape as fast as possible!

18:33.987 --> 18:34.905
Run!

18:52.047 --> 18:56.593
No matter how much we chase it,
we will never reach that baby.

18:57.219 --> 18:59.596
But at least, we caught the Stand.

19:00.180 --> 19:02.224
Jolyne, do you still not see

19:02.307 --> 19:05.644
what we were climbing toward?

19:07.354 --> 19:08.564
It was a gamble.

19:09.481 --> 19:12.317
The baby is intelligent and curious.

19:12.901 --> 19:15.487
Earlier, it touched the bottle I threw.

19:15.571 --> 19:18.824
When the baby chooses to touch an object,
its size stays the same.

19:18.907 --> 19:22.119
In other words,
the bottle's size hasn't changed.

19:24.371 --> 19:28.041
If we can't catch the baby,
we'll have the baby chase after us.

19:28.125 --> 19:29.960
We finally reached the bottle.

19:30.544 --> 19:32.713
The Stand is inside the bottle now.

19:32.796 --> 19:36.049
All we have to do now
is trap it inside the bottle!

19:37.509 --> 19:43.557
But… how are we getting out of here?

19:46.143 --> 19:51.106
I'm having Diver Drive enter
the bottle's wall.

19:51.732 --> 19:54.193
It's bringing the mouth to us.
Let's go, Jolyne.

19:54.943 --> 19:56.403
Run for it!

20:04.578 --> 20:05.913
We finally caught it.

20:07.122 --> 20:09.249
We got its User, the baby too.

20:15.839 --> 20:17.341
It's changing its position.

20:17.424 --> 20:19.426
It's using the bottle to charge forward!

20:26.934 --> 20:27.893
Anastasia!

20:27.976 --> 20:29.853
Stone Ocean!

20:30.938 --> 20:32.022
Jolyne!

20:32.105 --> 20:33.523
You can't break the bottle.

20:33.607 --> 20:36.026
We'll be worse off
if we have to face the Stand!

20:36.777 --> 20:40.739
Did the baby have this in mind
when it rolled the bottle?

20:40.822 --> 20:42.699
Shit, we're in deep trouble now!

20:43.450 --> 20:45.702
- Don't break the bottle!
- But…

20:45.786 --> 20:48.038
At this rate, you're done for!

21:14.856 --> 21:17.526
Anastasia, look…

21:18.610 --> 21:20.988
What the hell?

21:21.071 --> 21:23.073
What's going on?

21:23.156 --> 21:25.367
Jolyne, looks like…

21:26.118 --> 21:30.038
it's interested in the star-shaped
birthmark on your left shoulder.

21:30.622 --> 21:35.252
Since it touched you,
we turned back to our original size.

21:37.546 --> 21:41.049
The baby has the same birthmark
on its shoulder.

21:41.758 --> 21:43.260
What's going on?

21:44.219 --> 21:47.139
The baby acts like it has known
Jolyne for a long time.

21:47.723 --> 21:52.477
Hey, it looks as if it likes me.

21:52.561 --> 21:54.021
What should I do?

21:54.104 --> 21:56.857
It likes her? No, that's not it.

21:57.441 --> 21:59.151
I have no doubt about it.

21:59.234 --> 22:01.194
He will turn against us.

22:01.278 --> 22:05.407
I can only sense endless darkness
from this baby's ability.

22:06.074 --> 22:09.911
Yes, we may need this baby

22:09.995 --> 22:12.205
to retrieve your father's disc
from Pale Snake,

22:12.289 --> 22:15.042
but I must kill it while I can.

23:41.294 --> 23:46.299
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
